16.Use ROW_NUMBER() to assign a sequence number to each order by customer_name.


select customer_id,customer_name,row_number() over(order by customer_name desc) as Rownumber
from ecommerce_sales


17.Use RANK() to rank products by total sales.

select product_name,sum(price*quantity) as totalsales,
RANK()OVER(order by sum(price*quantity) desc) as RankOrder
from ecommerce_sales
group by product_name;


18.Find the top 3 customers with the highest spending.

select product_name,sum(price*quantity) as totalsales,
RANK()OVER(order by sum(price*quantity) desc) as RankOrder
from ecommerce_sales
group by product_name
order by RankOrder 
limit 3;
